---
title: 'Between the Easy Yes and Definitive No: Seeking God in the Land of Maybe'
author: lisa-massotti
excerpt: >-
  At the beginning of Amos Chapter 7, when God revealed His first two visions to
  Amos...
date: 2026-10-05
category: AMOS
